    note: `A public corporate site covering the firm, its capabilities, its people, contact and disclosures starts from ${P.site}. Add an audience-tagged content layer, declaration capture, a managed file set and a second language and the work sits in our larger build range from ${P.seoSite}. An authenticated investor or client portal with per-account document visibility and a download trail is custom software from ${P.software}. Automating enquiry routing, onboarding document chasing or report distribution starts from ${P.ai}, and ongoing search work is a separate monthly line from ${P.seo}. The number that moves a quote on this kind of project is rarely page count. It is the count of distinct permission positions you have to express, whether the site serves one entity or a group, how many audience tiers the content layer needs, and whether you publish in Arabic as well as English. Everything is itemised in USD, nothing is billed before you approve the quote in writing, and the rate card sits on our <a href='/pricing/'>pricing page</a>.`,
